    "section": "19. Attached Units",
    "ruleNumber": "19.03",
    "order": 225,
    "anchor": "19.03",
    "summary": "An **Attached unit** has [every keyword](vsdata:core-rule/keywords) of each unit it is built from, so rules aimed at any of those keywords affect it. Its models never gain keywords held only by other models in it, and attacks still target the unit, not models.",
